#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:2
msgid "morpheus-ctl tips"
msgstr "Conseils morpheus-ctl"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:4
msgid ""
"``morpheus-ctl`` is useful beyond reconfigures and starting the ui, and "
"many commands can be run across all services, or scoped to a singe "
"service."
msgstr "``morpheus-ctl`` est utile au-delà des reconfigurations et du démarrage de l'interface utilisateur, et de nombreuses commandes peuvent être exécutées sur tous les services ou limitées à un seul service."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:6
msgid "Some common commands include:"
msgstr "Voici quelques commandes courantes :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:8
msgid "morpheus-ctl status"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:9
msgid "Lists all the installed services and their current status"
msgstr "Répertorie tous les services installés et leur état actuel"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:10
msgid "morpheus-ctl start (service)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:11
msgid ""
"This starts all services if no service is specified, or starts the "
"specified service. For example,"
msgstr "Cela démarre tous les services si aucun service n'est spécifié, ou démarre le service spécifié. Par exemple,"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:13
msgid ""
"``morpheus-ctl start/stop/restart/kill`` on an all-in-one appliance will "
"start, stop, restart or kill mysql, elasticsearch, rabbitmq, check-"
"server, guacd and the morpheus-ui, one by one."
msgstr "``morpheus-ctl start/stop/restart/kill`` sur une appliance tout-en-un démarre, arrête, redémarre ou tue mysql, elasticsearch, rabbitmq, check-server, guacd et morpheus-ui, un par un."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:14
msgid ""
"``morpheus-ctl start/stop/restart/kill morpheus-ui`` will only start, "
"stop, restart or kill the morpheus-ui service, leaving the other service "
"in their current state.  Same goes for ``morpheus-ctl "
"start/stop/restart/kill mysql``, ``morpheus-ctl start/stop/restart/kill "
"elasticsearch`` etc."
msgstr "``morpheus-ctl start/stop/restart/kill morpheus-ui`` ne démarre, arrête, redémarre ou tue que le service morpheus-ui, laissant les autres services dans leur état actuel. Il en va de même pour ``morpheus-ctl start/stop/restart/kill mysql``, ``morpheus-ctl start/stop/restart/kill elasticsearch``, etc."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:17
msgid "``morpheus-ctl`` commands:"
msgstr "Commandes ``morpheus-ctl`` :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:19
msgid ""
"General Commands:\n"
"\n"
"  cleanse\n"
"    Delete *all* morpheus data, and start from scratch.\n"
"  help\n"
"    Print this help message.\n"
"  reconfigure\n"
"    Reconfigure the application. Reconfigure is not a general credential-"
"rotation operation; for example, it does not change the password of an "
"existing appliance-managed RabbitMQ user. See "
":doc:`/getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq` before changing "
"RabbitMQ credentials.\n"
"  show-config\n"
"    Show the configuration that would be generated by reconfigure.\n"
"  uninstall\n"
"    Kill all processes and uninstall the process supervisor (data will be"
" preserved).\n"
"\n"
" Service Management Commands:\n"
"\n"
"   graceful-kill\n"
"     Attempt a graceful stop, then SIGKILL the entire process group.\n"
"   hup\n"
"     Send the services a HUP.\n"
"   int\n"
"     Send the services an INT.\n"
"   kill\n"
"     Send the services a KILL.\n"
"   once\n"
"     Start the services if they are down. Do not restart them if they "
"stop.\n"
"   restart\n"
"     Stop the services if they are running, then start them again.\n"
"   service-list\n"
"     List all the services (enabled services appear with a *.)\n"
"   start\n"
"     Start services if they are down, and restart them if they stop.\n"
"   status\n"
"     Show the status of all the services.\n"
"   stop\n"
"     Stop the services, and do not restart them.\n"
"   tail\n"
"     Watch the service logs of all enabled services.\n"
"   term\n"
"     Send the services a TERM.\n"
"\n"
" Elasticsearch Commands:\n"
"\n"
"   elastic-util\n"
"     Backup/Restore ElasticSearch data\n"
"\n"
" Firewall Commands:\n"
"\n"
"   firewall-enable-blocking\n"
"     Enables firewall blocking mode."
msgstr ""

